WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:06.624
This is the Kang Cai workshop in Dongguan, where adjustable bed frames are made.

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:11.488
Steel sections and frame parts move across the production floor.

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:19.440
At the welding station, an operator and a welding robot work side by side to join frame components.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:26.160
Racks of frame parts wait for the next stage of assembly.

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:34.952
Every program starts with your brief: the market, the functions and the quantity. Send us yours.

